        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eshirabu eshikanye, neLikondi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndalola, mumukhono musaatsa kwa oyo owali niyeekhaale khushifumbi shioburuchi, eshitabu eshikanye eshiahandiikwa tsimbeka tsiombi, nishiboheelwe butinyu ebibalikho musaafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalola malaika undi owamaani narumbukha nomwoyo omukhongo, ari Niwina oukwanile okhukanyulula eshitabu nokhufunaka ebibalikho biashio? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne yabulayo mwikulu, kata mushialo, kata musi weshialo, owali nanyala okhukanyulula eshitabu, kata okhushihengakhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi ndalila muno, shichila shiyanyoolekha omundu yesi oukwanile okhukanyulula eshitabu, kata okhuhengamwo ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana oundi owokhubakofu abo niyamboolela ari Oralila tawe; lola, Italanyi eyo eyili yoluyia lwaYuda, Eshisina shiaDaudi, wamala okhuhula, ne ye anyala okhukanyulula eshitabu nokhufunaka ebibalikho biashio.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana hakari weshifumbi shiene nende ebilimwoyo ebio bine, hakari wabakofu abo, ndalola Likondi lieshimwamwane nilisinjiileho, shinga eliali niliirilwe; liali nende tsinzika musaafu netsimoni musaafu, nibo Abaroho musaafu baNyasaye abarumwa mushialo shiosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Likondi oyo niyeetsa, nashibukula mumukhono musaatsa kwa oyo owali niyeekhaale khushifumbi shioburuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali nabukuule eshitabu, ebilimwoyo ebio bine nende abakofu amakhumi kabili nabane bakwa mumakulu keLikondi tsana. Buli mukofu yali nelitungu; khandi bali nebikaye bieitsahaabu ebialimwo amalesi kelibuuliesi, niko amasaayo kabatakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibeemba olwimbo oluyia, bari",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
